[LineDescription "Retreat straight back, so you can take the opposition when the pawn moves."]

{[%csl Rd2,Re2,Rf2,Rd1,Re1,Rf1] Straight back, in front of the pawn. Black's
pawn is on e3. You are White: hold the draw. Red squares: the key squares
Black's king must never reach.} 1. Ke1 {Straight back, in front of the pawn. Now
you can take the opposition after the pawn moves.} 1... Kc3 {[%csl
Rd2,Re2,Rf2,Rd1,Re1,Rf1]} 2. Ke2 Kc4 {[%csl Rd2,Re2,Rf2,Rd1,Re1,Rf1]} 3. Kxe3
{You win the pawn: draw!} *

